Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:01:40 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] US-9.4: damage warning reads the player's live maximum

- Entity.setMaxHp clamps to at least 1 and pulls current hp down
- DamageMeter stores the fraction and computes the level per event
- CarryOverTest holds the US-8.5 tests (plus the missing Vampiric case) and the US-9.4 test
- Remove unused DungeonLevel local in GameWorld

